    <summary>Launch applications, folders and web sites with global keyboard shortcuts.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[HotkeyLauncher launches programs, scripts, documents, folders and web sites with global keyboard shortcuts.

## Features
- Global shortcuts (e.g. `Ctrl + Alt + N` opens Notepad from anywhere)
- Programs with arguments, scripts (`.ps1`, `.bat`, `.cmd`), documents, folders, web sites and links
- Run as administrator, run hidden, bring an already running window to the front, window position and screen
- Quick launcher: press `Win + Alt + Space`, type a few letters, press Enter
- Notification-area menu with search, groups, drag & drop, usage statistics
- On-screen keyboard showing which key combinations are free (follows your keyboard layout)
- Export / import, automatic backups, light / dark theme
- Interface in English, French, Spanish and German

Settings are stored in `%APPDATA%\HotkeyLauncher`, so they are kept across upgrades.

Successor of [RapidApp](https://sourceforge.net/projects/rapidapp/).
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/sybaris/HotkeyLauncher/releases/tag/vx.y.z</releaseNotes>
